DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ich such Fossilien!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Wenn ich eins gefunden hab,
grab ich's mit dieser Schaufel aus.
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Aber ob ich je eins finde,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

EN:
Are you{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}checking out my net there,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0012:}}I knew it!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Even if it looks like a regular old
net,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} it's actually one of a kind!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
No one else has one like this!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}A huh huh huh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It's even got a
hidden secret pocket in it,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:002A:}}I'm about to catch the biggest fish{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
in the history of fish!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}A huh huh huh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} And when I do,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I hope I make it into the history
books too,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:002A:}}Je vais attraper le plus gros poisson{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
de l'histoire de la poissonnerie !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ha ha ha !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Et quand je l'aurai pris,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
je ferai les plus grosses papillotes
du monde,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:002A:}}Tra poco pescherò il pesce{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
più grande della storia!
Me lo sento!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Ah ah ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Vedrai che presto{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
il mio nome finirà sui libri
di storia della pesca,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Su çiçeklerin yemeği gibidir!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}O yüzden
sularken{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} onlara bir porsiyon {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}
servis ediyormuşum gibi yapıyorum!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I don't mind rainy days too much.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
They give me a good excuse to bust
out my cool umbrella!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}J'aime bien quand il pleut, moi.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Comme ça, mon joli parapluie peut
s'étirer un peu !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}La pioggia non mi dispiace.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Così ho una scusa per tirare fuori
il mio ombrello preferito!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Havalı bir şemsiyenin en güzel yanı
çok yönlü olması.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Yağmurda kuru kalmak için{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} kullanırsın.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ya da çevirip durur, caka satarsın!
